*.ipin VIN_ota
*.opin VO_ota
*.iopin Iref
*.iopin VSS
*.iopin VDD
*.ipin VIP_ota
XMr Iref Iref VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 L=0.15 W=1 nf=1 ad=0.29 as=0.29 pd=2.58 ps=2.58 nrd=0.29 nrs=0.29 sa=0 sb=0 sd=0
+ mult=1
XMo VO_ota VO_ota VDD VDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 L=0.15 W=1 nf=1 ad=0.29 as=0.29 pd=2.58 ps=2.58 nrd=0.29 nrs=0.29 sa=0 sb=0 sd=0
+ mult=1
XMrc1 Vtail Iref VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 L=0.15 W=1 nf=1 ad=0.29 as=0.29 pd=2.58 ps=2.58 nrd=0.29 nrs=0.29 sa=0 sb=0 sd=0
+ mult=1
XMc2 VO_ota Iref VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 L=0.15 W=1 nf=1 ad=0.29 as=0.29 pd=2.58 ps=2.58 nrd=0.29 nrs=0.29 sa=0 sb=0 sd=0
+ mult=1
XMn VGP VIN_ota Vtail VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 L=0.15 W=1 nf=1 ad=0.29 as=0.29 pd=2.58 ps=2.58 nrd=0.29 nrs=0.29 sa=0 sb=0 sd=0
+ mult=1
XMp VO_ota VIP_ota Vtail VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 L=0.15 W=1 nf=1 ad=0.29 as=0.29 pd=2.58 ps=2.58 nrd=0.29 nrs=0.29 sa=0 sb=0
+ sd=0 mult=1
XMpr VO_ota VGP VDD VDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 L=0.15 W=1 nf=1 ad=0.29 as=0.29 pd=2.58 ps=2.58 nrd=0.29 nrs=0.29 sa=0 sb=0 sd=0
+ mult=1
XMnr VGP VGP VDD VDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 L=0.15 W=1 nf=1 ad=0.29 as=0.29 pd=2.58 ps=2.58 nrd=0.29 nrs=0.29 sa=0 sb=0 sd=0
+ mult=1
.ends

.end
